# No em dash (tvscreener-rs)

The Unicode em dash (code point **U+2014**) is forbidden in this project:

- code, comments, strings
- docs, README, commit messages
- Cursor rules themselves (name the code point; do not paste the glyph)

Use ASCII hyphen `-`, colon `:`, commas, parentheses, or `|` instead.

If you see U+2014 in a file you touch, remove it. Search with `rg $'\u2014'`.
